# Reference releases: only the active copy and the release it was made from are tracked,
# so a fresh clone can set up a database (npm run db:init). Older releases stay local.
# When a new release is published, replace the version below with the new one.
/releases/*
!/releases/README.md
!/releases/current/
!/releases/v10.7.0/

